            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life and Blue Period</strong><br>\nPablo Picasso was born in 1881 in Málaga, Spain, and displayed artistic talent from an early age. He moved to Paris in 1900, where he entered his Blue Period, characterized by monochromatic paintings in shades of blue, reflecting his struggle with poverty and depression.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Rose Period and African Art Influence</strong><br>\nFollowing the Blue Period, Picasso's Rose Period brought warmer colors and the introduction of circus performers and clowns into his work. His interest in African art also began to emerge, profoundly influencing the development of his style.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Cubism and Analytic Approach</strong><br>\nPicasso co-founded Cubism with Georges Braque, and from 1909 onwards, they began to deconstruct objects into abstract, geometric forms, abandoning traditional perspective. This phase, known as Analytic Cubism, was a groundbreaking shift in the visual arts.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          }
        ],
        "slideBackgroundSelector": {}
      },
      {
        "elements": [
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 4.415011037527593,
            "width": 37.98882681564246,
            "height": 8.830022075055187,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:1.5em;\"><strong>INFORMATION TEXT (Part 2)</strong></span></p>\n"
